nt-2672515168","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103069","id":2672515168,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fS1hg","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-20T19:44:19Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T19:44:44Z","body":"This is likely the same as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/53534 and is a byproduct of the large area soft shadows display on (and the limited sample count). Try increasing the shadow filter quality project setting or enable TAA/FSR2, so that samples are jittered over time since 4.4.beta.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2672515168/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2673995683","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103069#issuecomment-2673995683","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103069","id":2673995683,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fYe-j","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-21T09:11:31Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T09:11:31Z","body":"I posted the issue after having increased the `rendering/lights_and_shadows/directional_shadow/soft_shadow_filter_quality` to Soft Ultra. Turns out that at the time the setting was not being updated in real-time!\n\nHence, when I restarted the project today, the shadows were fine. Also, weirdly, today, changing `soft_shadow_filter_quailty` is being updated in real-time.\n\nSo I think we can close this issue; there was just something preventing the real-time update of the settings.\n\nBy the way, concerning TAA, it creates artefacts, so I am not using it at the moment; might do a bug report at some point.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2673995683/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]